# https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ford_Fiesta
# Ford Fiesta Mk6 (B299, UK Mk7): production from August 2008, European facelift
# 2013; the Fiesta was the most numerous car on GB roads from late 2015 (DfT
# VEH0120: 1,427,082 at end-2015).
#
# Colours: Panther Black, Moondust Silver, Performance Blue, Sea Grey. The
# paint names are the actual Ford offerings with their availability years
# (Panther Black mica 1997-2019, Moondust Silver 1991-2026, Performance Blue
# 2002-2026, Sea Grey 2006-2026). These are the four largest measured DVSA
# first-registration shares over the model's road years 2008-2017: black 21.2%,
# silver 16.4%, blue 15.4%, grey 15.0%. White (13.7%) was the next measured
# colour and is not modelled.
#
# Dates are staggered per colour by observed road presence. Weights total 500,
# the 2026-11-15 anchor convention for the Fiesta (provisional; a central
# rebase follows), split 21.2:16.4:15.4:15.0.

